`o 6 r 5(4) the period for the limitation to expire after issue` MEANS Period WITH
    `period length` IS 14
    `period unit` IS Days
    `period direction` IS `After the anchor`

-- src:519 | (4) Except in a special case, an originating claim may be endorsed generally only if the limitation period for the cause of action will expire within
-- src:519 | 14 days after the originating claim is issued.
@ref O 6 r 5(4) (src:519)
